[0.0-1.2] spk0: Hello?
[1.7-7.3] spk1: Hi Mr. Sterling! This is Brenda from the Friends of the Maplewood Library. You won our autumn raffle!
[7.8-11.0] spk0: The library raffle? I bought a ticket at the book sale!
[11.5-17.5] spk1: You sure did, and we just pulled your name for the hundred-dollar gift certificate to Miller's Garden Center.
[18.0-22.0] spk0: Well isn't that nice! Wait, you don't want a processing fee, do you?
[22.5-28.1] spk1: Heavens no! It's sitting in an envelope at the main circulation desk with your name on it.
[28.6-31.8] spk0: Do I need to bring anything special to claim it?
[32.3-38.3] spk1: Just bring your library card or photo ID next time you stroll in for your mysteries.
